# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system ea0e4b7e9f6c5ca63cab88ea929122ee8463a78426f514094fd7af23e45f3618
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 3fc31b22629811bd305977bc8b9b778069752ead2bc212b96b51875ca99efed7
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 0f2367f38a428f26fb517aa8f9c6cf04ff993a8bf6fb511b5ea4e1f07aee78d1
